{"availability":"available","full":"vanyastaff/flui","name":"flui","description":"A Flutter-inspired declarative UI framework for Rust, rendered with wgpu.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Rust","stars":2,"forks":1,"created":"2025-10-21T11:49:35Z","updated":"2026-10-09T15:38:32Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://vanyastaff.github.io/flui/","topics":["cross-platform","declarative-ui","flutter","gui","rust","ui-framework","wgpu"],"demo":"https://vanyastaff.github.io/flui/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T15:39:12.119Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T15:39:12.119Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T15:39:12.119Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T15:39:12.119Z","stars":2,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Flutter","Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[]( [](README.md#license) [](README.md#minimum-supported-rust-version)","A modular declarative UI framework for Rust with GPU-accelerated rendering.","FLUI brings Flutter's tree architecture to Rust as five trees — View (immutable configuration) → Element (lifecycle, reconciliation) → RenderObject (layout, paint, hit-test) → Layer (compositing, rebuilt each frame), with Semantics alongside for accessibility — adapted to native ownership, type-safe arity, and a strict layered crate DAG. The widget catalog (flui-widgets) is live, the full build → layout → paint → composite pipeline runs end to end, and gestures and animation are integrated."],"features":["Five-tree pipeline. Immutable View → Element → RenderObject → Layer, with Semantics alongside. Build / Layout / Paint phases run on demand only.","Type-safe arity. Render children parameterized by Leaf, Single, Optional, Variable — child-count mismatches become compile-time errors.","GPU-first rendering. wgpu 30 backend with lyon tessellation, Parley shaping, and an engine-owned glyph atlas for text.","Cross-platform, unevenly verified. Native Win32 and AppKit backends, headless mode for CI, an Android NDK target, WASM/WebGPU, and a winit fallback all build, but how far each has actually been run and checked differs…","Hot-reload scenes. dlopen-based plugin host (flui-hot-reload) for desktop iteration without process restarts."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/vanyastaff/flui/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"1f381cc8623a58262fcea39ebe2abda7a17f2e27fc9645bc96bc67e2991792dd","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T15:39:12.553Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T15:39:12.553Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"[]( [](README.md#license) [](README.md#minimum-supported-rust-version)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/vanyastaff/flui/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"1f381cc8623a58262fcea39ebe2abda7a17f2e27fc9645bc96bc67e2991792dd","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/vanyastaff/flui/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T15:39:12.553Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T15:38:32Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/vanyastaff/flui/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T15:39:12.555Z","hash":"1f381cc8623a58262fcea39ebe2abda7a17f2e27fc9645bc96bc67e2991792dd","originalBytes":14987,"storedBytes":14987,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["flui","docs","build","flutter","examples","see","rust","crate","off","cargo","new","platform","run","material","test","widgets","architecture","each","every","layer","layout","state","widget","android","catalog","counterstate","counterview","crates","cupertino","default","impl","license","one","self","view","xtask","app","code","ctx","element","feature","features","install","it.","live","native","notice","paint","path","pipeline","project","target","there","under","window","adapted","animation","apache-2.0","architecture.md","beta","button","checks","clone","column","count","counter","counterapp","create","dag","declarative","derive","design","desktop","development","dyn","foundations.md","framework","getting-started.md","hot-reload","input","layered","mit","